  "HINTS.boss.text": "Bosses hit the stage hard if they get through. Save your hero abilities for them.",
  "HINTS.boss.title": "Boss!",
  "HINTS.boss_compressor.text": "It squashes big hits, so one huge shot barely hurts it. Use lots of fast, small hits instead, and watch for the shield it pops out.",
  "HINTS.boss_compressor.title": "The Compressor",
  "HINTS.boss_djglitch.text": "It teleports along the path and jams your nearest turrets. Spread your turrets out so one scratch never stops the whole band.",
  "HINTS.boss_djglitch.title": "DJ Glitch",
  "HINTS.boss_lowpass.text": "It washes over small hits, so fast weak shots barely scratch it. Bring big hitters like Kick Cannon and Cowbell Sniper.",
  "HINTS.boss_lowpass.title": "The Low-Pass Tide",
  "HINTS.boss_noisegate.text": "It slams shut every few seconds and nothing can hurt it, and it calls in Fuzz. Hold your hero moves until the gate opens again.",
  "HINTS.boss_noisegate.title": "Noise Gate",
  "HINTS.boss_playback.text": "He has three phases: he pauses your turrets, shields himself, then skips one of your tracks. Save your hero moves for his last phase.",
  "HINTS.boss_playback.title": "Mr. Playback",
  "HINTS.boss_reverb.text": "It echoes itself and leaves Echo Minis behind as it walks. Splash turrets like Kick Cannon clean up the pieces fast.",
  "HINTS.boss_reverb.title": "Reverb Titan",
  "HINTS.boss_silence.text": "It mutes your turrets in waves and can steal an instrument. Spread your turrets out so a mute never silences the whole band.",
  "HINTS.boss_silence.title": "Dr. Dead Air",
  "HINTS.brick.text": "Armored Static. Small hits bounce off it. Use big hitters like Kick Cannon and Cowbell Sniper.",
  "HINTS.brick.title": "Brickwall",
  "HINTS.chest.text": "Pick one Merch relic. Relics are unique and last the whole run.",
  "HINTS.chest.title": "Chest!",
  "HINTS.drone.text": "Flies straight to the stage and ignores the path. Turrets near the stage matter.",
  "HINTS.drone.title": "Autotune Drone",
  "HINTS.echo.text": "Splits into two minis when it dies. Splash damage cleans up the mess.",
  "HINTS.echo.title": "Echo",
  "HINTS.elite.text": "Glowing Static have a special trait. Golden ones drop lots of coins.",
  "HINTS.elite.title": "Elite Static",
  "HINTS.full.text": "No free tiles. Merge turrets to make room, or sell a weak one.",
  "HINTS.full.title": "Board full",
  "HINTS.fuzz.text": "Plain static. There is always a lot of it. Any turret handles it, splash is best.",
  "HINTS.fuzz.title": "Fuzz",
  "HINTS.gate.text": "Wears a shield that soaks damage and comes back if you stop hitting it. Burst it down.",
  "HINTS.gate.title": "Gate Guard",
  "HINTS.hint_bossphase.text": "Bosses change tricks as they lose health. Watch the notches on the boss bar: each one is a new phase. Stay flexible.",
  "HINTS.hint_bossphase.title": "Boss phase!",
  "HINTS.hint_branch.text": "A level 4 turret can pick one of two upgrade paths. Tap the turret with the star and choose. It is permanent for that turret.",
  "HINTS.hint_branch.title": "Upgrade path!",
  "HINTS.hint_hero_ready.text": "Roxor and Jasmin are charged up. Tap their portraits for the move shown under each one. Save it for a boss or a big wave.",
  "HINTS.hint_hero_ready.title": "Hero move ready",
  "HINTS.hint_preview.text": "Tap the WAVE box at the top to see exactly which Static are coming, lane by lane, before you call them.",
  "HINTS.hint_preview.title": "Peek at the next wave",
  "HINTS.hint_reroll.text": "The two round arrows under the board re-roll the next drop. Coins first, or gems when you are short. Setlist rerolls are free.",
  "HINTS.hint_reroll.title": "Not the turret you wanted?",
  "HINTS.hint_setlist.text": "Before a run, pick a hero move for Roxor and Jasmin. Modifiers are optional: each one makes the run harder and pays more Records, Fans and diamonds. Tap a modifier to read it.",
  "HINTS.hint_setlist.title": "Your Setlist",
  "HINTS.hint_skin_buy.text": "You have enough diamonds for a new look. Tap the price to buy it. Outfits and skins change how things look, never how the game plays.",
  "HINTS.hint_skin_buy.title": "Something to buy",
  "HINTS.hint_studio_scene.text": "This is your stage. Every Studio upgrade adds a prop here: amps, a riser, lights, even a tour van. Your hero level and outfits show up too.",
  "HINTS.hint_studio_scene.title": "Backstage",
  "HINTS.hint_synergy.text": "These two turrets are partners. Side by side (not diagonal) they boost each other. Tap a turret to see who it works well with.",
  "HINTS.hint_synergy.title": "Synergy!",
  "HINTS.hint_wardrobe.text": "Outfits and Stage skins are pure style. Tap one to wear it and swipe sideways for more. Some unlock by playing, some cost diamonds.",
  "HINTS.hint_wardrobe.title": "The Wardrobe",
  "HINTS.hint_weekly.text": "One special run each week, the same for everyone. The first try pays a big reward, replays pay half Records. The timer shows when it resets.",
  "HINTS.hint_weekly.title": "Weekly Gig",
  "HINTS.leech.text": "Heals other Static nearby. Kill it first (set a turret to Strongest or use Mic and Synth).",
  "HINTS.leech.title": "Hum Healer",
  "HINTS.mod.text": "Some waves have a twist, shown under the wave number. Good ones help you, bad ones pay extra coins.",
  "HINTS.mod.title": "Wave Twist",
  "HINTS.mute.text": "Immune to slows, stuns and push-backs. Raw damage only.",
  "HINTS.mute.title": "Mute Ghost",
  "HINTS.rager.text": "Goes berserk when hurt. Finish it quickly or slow it down early.",
  "HINTS.rager.title": "Glitchbug",
  "HINTS.squeal.text": "Screeches when it dies and jams nearby turrets for a moment. Kill it far from your gear.",
  "HINTS.squeal.title": "Feedback",
  "HINTS.zip.text": "Very fast and fragile. Splash and chain turrets are great here.",
  "HINTS.zip.title": "Glitch Zip",
  "LOOPY_TIPS.0": "Tip: matching turrets of the same level merge. Different types of the same level can remix into a surprise.",
  "LOOPY_TIPS.1": "Tip: tap an empty tile first, then DROP to place the next turret exactly there.",
  "LOOPY_TIPS.10": "Tip: clear a stage with 3 stars for bonus diamonds and better loot.",
  "LOOPY_TIPS.11": "Tip: the Studio upgrades are permanent. Spend your Records after every run.",
  "LOOPY_TIPS.12": "Tip: higher Encore levels make stages harder and pay a lot more.",
  "LOOPY_TIPS.13": "Tip: Sub Bass slows enemies, which makes every other turret hit more often.",
  "LOOPY_TIPS.14": "Tip: kills in a row build a combo that boosts coins.",
  "LOOPY_TIPS.2": "Tip: drop on the beat for a discount. Watch the ring around the DROP button.",
  "LOOPY_TIPS.3": "Tip: Loop Station and Amp Stack do not shoot. Put them between your attackers.",
  "LOOPY_TIPS.4": "Tip: set a turret to Strongest to focus bosses, or Last to pick off stragglers.",
  "LOOPY_TIPS.5": "Tip: use Roxor and Jasmin within 2 seconds of each other for a Duet Finale.",
  "LOOPY_TIPS.6": "Tip: save the Beatbox Blast for bosses and big waves.",
  "LOOPY_TIPS.7": "Tip: gear can be merged too. Three of the same piece make the next rarity.",
  "LOOPY_TIPS.8": "Tip: sell weak level 1 turrets late in a run to make room and get coins back.",
  "LOOPY_TIPS.9": "Tip: Remix cards stack. Doubling down on one idea often beats spreading out.",
